  FT["PH-H8217"] = {"id":"PH-H8217","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9759_2009.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将北苏里高省 Del Carmen 市镇的 San Isidro 国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Del Carmen 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex in the Municipality of Del Carmen, Province of Surigao Del Norte from the San Isidro National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Del Carmen National High School, and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex in the Municipality of Del Carmen, Province of Surigao Del Norte from the San Isidro National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Del Carmen National High School, and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Del Carmen của Trường Trung học San Isidro Quốc gia tại Đô thị Del Carmen, Tỉnh Surigao Del Norte khỏi Trường Trung học San Isidro Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Del Carmen Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Del Carmen ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา San Isidro แห่งชาติในเทศบาล Del Carmen จังหวัด Surigao Del Norte ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา San Isidro แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Del Carmen แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Del Carmen, Sekolah Menengah San Isidro Nasional di Kotamadya Del Carmen, Provinsi Surigao Del Norte dari Sekolah Menengah San Isidro Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Del Carmen Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Del Carmen, Sekolah Menengah San Isidro Kebangsaan di Perbandaran Del Carmen, Wilayah Surigao Del Norte daripada Sekolah Menengah San Isidro Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Del Carmen Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 9759","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2009-11-10","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9759_2009.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8217-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. - The San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex in the Municipality of Del Carmen, Province of Surigao del Norte is hereby separated from the San Isidro National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Del Carmen National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8217-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. - All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Del Carmen National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8217-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. - The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department's program the operationalization of the Del Carmen National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year's appropriations of the San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8217-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. - The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8217-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. - This Act shall take effect fIfteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p117","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the San Isidro National High School - Del Carmen Annex in the Municipality of Del Carmen, Province of Surigao Del Norte from the San Isidro National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Del Carmen National High School, and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
