  FT["PH-H8224"] = {"id":"PH-H8224","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9766_2009.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将东明多洛省Gloria市镇Malubay描笼涯的Malamig国立中学分校分离出来，单独改设为独立的Manuel Adriano纪念国立中学（MAMNHS），并为此拨付所需经费","en":"An Act Separating the Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension in Barangay Malubay, Municipality of Gloria, Province of Oriental Mindoro from the Malamig National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS) and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension in Barangay Malubay, Municipality of Gloria, Province of Oriental Mindoro from the Malamig National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS) and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Malubay của Trường Trung học Malamig Quốc gia tại Barangay Malubay, Đô thị Gloria, Tỉnh Oriental Mindoro khỏi Trường Trung học Malamig Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Tưởng niệm Manuel Adriano Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Malubay ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Malamig แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Malubay เทศบาล Gloria จังหวัด Oriental Mindoro ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Malamig แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาอนุสรณ์ Manuel Adriano แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Malubay, Sekolah Menengah Malamig Nasional di Barangay Malubay, Kotamadya Gloria, Provinsi Oriental Mindoro dari Sekolah Menengah Malamig Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Memorial Manuel Adriano Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Malubay, Sekolah Menengah Malamig Kebangsaan di Barangay Malubay, Perbandaran Gloria, Wilayah Oriental Mindoro daripada Sekolah Menengah Malamig Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Memorial Manuel Adriano Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 9766","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2009-11-10","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9766_2009.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8224-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. - The Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension in Barangay Malubay, Municipality of Gloria. Province of Oriental Mindoro is hereby separated from the Malamig National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS)."}},{"id":"PH-H8224-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. - All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS)."}},{"id":"PH-H8224-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. - The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department's program the operationalization of the Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS), the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year's appropriations of the Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8224-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. - The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8224-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. - This Act shall take effect fifteen·(15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p117","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Malamig National High School - Malubay Extension in Barangay Malubay, Municipality of Gloria, Province of Oriental Mindoro from the Malamig National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Manuel Adriano Memorial National High School (MAMNHS) and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
