  FT["PH-H8265"] = {"id":"PH-H8265","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9807_2009.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将南哥打巴托省 Lake Sebu 市镇 Ned 描笼涯的 Lake Sebu 国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Ned 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex in Barangay Ned, Municipality of Lake Sebu, Province of South Cotabato from the Lake Sebu National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Ned National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex in Barangay Ned, Municipality of Lake Sebu, Province of South Cotabato from the Lake Sebu National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Ned National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Ned của Trường Trung học Lake Sebu Quốc gia tại Barangay Ned, Đô thị Lake Sebu, Tỉnh South Cotabato khỏi Trường Trung học Lake Sebu Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Ned Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Ned ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Lake Sebu แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Ned เทศบาล Lake Sebu จังหวัด South Cotabato ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Lake Sebu แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Ned แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Ned, Sekolah Menengah Lake Sebu Nasional di Barangay Ned, Kotamadya Lake Sebu, Provinsi South Cotabato dari Sekolah Menengah Lake Sebu Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Ned Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Ned, Sekolah Menengah Lake Sebu Kebangsaan di Barangay Ned, Perbandaran Lake Sebu, Wilayah South Cotabato daripada Sekolah Menengah Lake Sebu Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Ned Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 9807","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2009-11-26","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2009/ra_9807_2009.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8265-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. - The Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex in Barangay Ned, Municipality of Lake Sebu, Province of South Cotabato is hereby separated from the Lake Sebu National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Ned National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8265-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. - All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Ned National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8265-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department's program the operationalization of the Ned National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year's appropriations of the Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8265-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. - The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8265-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. - This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p117","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Lake Sebu National High School - Ned Annex in Barangay Ned, Municipality of Lake Sebu, Province of South Cotabato from the Lake Sebu National High School, Converting it into an Independent National High School to Be Known as Ned National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
